WEBVTT

00:00.558 --> 00:07.023
I'm in a courtroom, cold and grey. She's on the

00:07.103 --> 00:13.348
left side, across the way. A lawyer spinning

00:13.408 --> 00:18.372
twisted lies about the boy he's incapacitated.

00:18.392 --> 00:25.097
A captive who's been manipulated. They've been

00:25.237 --> 00:30.861
