01:31.660 --> 01:35.582
tearing off a broken roof. And in the back, This

01:35.602 --> 01:40.665
is not a case of incapacity. This is apparent.

02:04.322 --> 02:08.723
who can't let go. This

02:08.803 --> 02:13.165
